Fix: resolve Windows backend DLL dependencies from the backend's own directory

Base commit: 9a3bf2b84923a85583b4ee8177b0cca13824bb03 (gguf-v0.19.0-1114-g9a3bf2b84)

Root cause: on Windows, dl_load_library() loads backend DLLs (ggml-cpu.dll,
ggml-vulkan.dll) with a plain LoadLibraryW() given an absolute path. The
absolute path locates the backend itself, but the loader resolves the
backend's dependent DLLs (ggml-base.dll, vulkan-1.dll, ...) using the
process-wide legacy DLL search order (application dir, system32, ..., PATH)
-- it does NOT search the directory the backend DLL itself was loaded from,
and it does NOT consult directories added via AddDllDirectory (those are
only consulted by loads that pass LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_USER_DIRS, e.g.
Python's extension imports and ctypes).

Packaged layouts that keep the backend outside every searched directory
(e.g. pip wheel: site-packages/mineru_llama_cpp/bin) therefore fail to load
the backends entirely, surfacing later as:

    make_cpu_buft_list: no CPU backend found

Fix: use LoadLibraryExW with LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DLL_LOAD_DIR so the
backend's own directory participates in dependency resolution, plus
LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DEFAULT_DIRS to preserve the normal safe search set
(application dir, system32, and any AddDllDirectory user dirs).

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-backend-dl.cpp b/ggml/src/ggml-backend-dl.cpp
index a65cf0090..13dea48f6 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-backend-dl.cpp
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-backend-dl.cpp
@@ -7,7 +7,18 @@ dl_handle * dl_load_library(const fs::path & path) {
     DWORD old_mode = SetErrorMode(SEM_FAILCRITICALERRORS);
     SetErrorMode(old_mode | SEM_FAILCRITICALERRORS);
 
-    HMODULE handle = LoadLibraryW(path.wstring().c_str());
+    // LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DLL_LOAD_DIR: also resolve the backend's own
+    // dependencies from the backend DLL's directory. A plain LoadLibraryW
+    // with an absolute path does NOT search that directory for the backend's
+    // dependent DLLs -- it falls back to the process DLL search path
+    // (application dir, system32, PATH), which breaks packaged layouts where
+    // the backend and its dependency (ggml-base.dll etc.) live outside any
+    // searched directory (e.g. site-packages/mineru_llama_cpp/bin).
+    HMODULE handle = LoadLibraryExW(
+        path.wstring().c_str(),
+        nullptr,
+        LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DLL_LOAD_DIR | LOAD_LIBRARY_SEARCH_DEFAULT_DIRS
+    );
 
     SetErrorMode(old_mode);
 
